<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal">Dear {!Contact.Name},<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">The <b>Wadhwani Foundation</b> (<a href="https://wadhwanifoundation.org/"><i>www.wadhwanifoundation.org</i></a>)
has been actively working towards its&nbsp;primary mission of accelerating
economic development by driving job creation through various program
initiatives in skilling, entrepreneurship, digital transformation, driven by
research and innovation. Founded by Silicon Valley entrepreneur Dr. Romesh
Wadhwani, the Foundation is scaling impact through programs that leverage the
latest technology and network access of world-class resources to improve
livelihoods and change lives through the application of technology and
innovation. <i>Dr. Romesh Wadhwani</i> also serves on the Governing Board of the
Anusandhan National Research Foundation (ANRF), Chaired by the Hon. PM of
India.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><br>
Wadhwani Innovation Network (WIN), a program by the Wadhwani Foundation, is
aimed at accelerating India’s global innovation leadership by transforming
academic research into impactful solutions by promoting techno-entrepreneurship
through WIN-COEs established in leading institutions like IITs, IISc, C-CAMP
etc, in high-impact research areas such as AI, Quantum Computing,
Bioengineering, HealthTech, Critical Minerals etc<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">In this endeavour, the Wadhwani Foundation would request you
to kindly consider to serve on the panel of subject experts in &lt;Expert field
1&gt;, &lt;Expert Field 2&gt;, &lt;Expert Field 3&gt; to&nbsp;help us evaluate R&amp;D projects&nbsp;from
various WIN Centres&nbsp;for funding. Needless to mention that your valuable
expertise and time will be duly compensated. As a standard practice, you will
be required to sign a confidentiality and a conflict-of-interest form if you do
choose to accept this invitation. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Please register on our platform using [this link] if you
would like to join us in driving this mission. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Thanks,<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">WIN Management Team<o:p></o:p></p>]]></td>
